Web app, Mobile app, Partner API client -> CDN
CDN -> API gateway
API gateway -> Auth, Rate limiter
API gateway -> Catalog, Cart, Orders, Search, Accounts
Auth -> Accounts
Cart -> Catalog, Pricing
Orders -> Cart, Payments, Inventory, Order database
Payments -> Card processor, Fraud check, Ledger
Fraud check -> Risk model
Inventory -> Warehouse system, Inventory database
Catalog -> Catalog database, Image store
Search -> Search index
Catalog -> Event bus
Orders -> Event bus
Payments -> Event bus
Inventory -> Event bus
Event bus -> Indexer, Notifier, Analytics sink, Ledger
Indexer -> Search index
Notifier -> Email provider, Push provider
Analytics sink -> Data lake
Data lake -> Risk model
Accounts -> Accounts database
Pricing -> Catalog database
Rate limiter -> Cache
Cart -> Cache
Clients {
  Web app, Mobile app, Partner API client
}
Edge {
  CDN, API gateway, Auth, Rate limiter
}
Services {
  Shopping {
    Catalog, Cart, Pricing, Search
  }
  Fulfilment {
    Orders, Payments, Inventory, Fraud check
  }
  Accounts
}
Async {
  Event bus, Indexer, Notifier, Analytics sink
}
Stores {
  Catalog database, Order database, Inventory database, Accounts database, Search index, Cache, Ledger, Image store, Data lake
}
External {
  Card processor, Warehouse system, Email provider, Push provider, Risk model
}
